@startuml
title BrainBox System Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

actor "Student / End User" as User

cloud "Google Identity Provider" as Google
cloud "Email Provider\n(Resend or SMTP)" as Email
cloud "AI Provider / Proxy API" as AIProvider
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Supabase-hosted)" as DB

package "Web Client\nReact 19 + Vite" as Web {
  [Auth Pages]
  [Dashboard, Library,\nQuizzes, Flashcards,\nPlaylists, Profile]
  [Notebook Editor\nwith AI Sidebar\nand Version History]
  [HTTP Client\nfetch + token refresh]
}

package "Mobile App\nAndroid + Kotlin" as Mobile {
  [Auth and Home Screens]
  [Playback UI + TTS]
  [Retrofit API Client]
  [Embedded Notebook Editor\nWebView Host Bridge]
}

package "Backend API\nSpring Boot REST" as API {
  [Controllers]
  [Auth Interceptor\n+ JWT Service]
  [Business Services]
  [Repositories]

  package "Feature Modules" as Features {
    [Authentication]
    [User/Profile]
    [Category]
    [Notebook]
    [Notebook Versioning]
    [AI Config + AI Query]
    [Quiz]
    [Flashcard]
    [Playlist]
    [Playback Queue]
    [Admin Endpoints]
  }
}

User --> Web : Uses browser app
User --> Mobile : Uses Android app

[Auth Pages] --> [HTTP Client\nfetch + token refresh]
[Dashboard, Library,\nQuizzes, Flashcards,\nPlaylists, Profile] --> [HTTP Client\nfetch + token refresh]
[Notebook Editor\nwith AI Sidebar\nand Version History] --> [HTTP Client\nfetch + token refresh]
[Auth and Home Screens] --> [Retrofit API Client]
[Playback UI + TTS] --> [Retrofit API Client]
[Embedded Notebook Editor\nWebView Host Bridge] --> [Retrofit API Client]

[HTTP Client\nfetch + token refresh] --> API : HTTPS REST API\nBearer token + refresh token
[Retrofit API Client] --> API : HTTPS REST API\nBearer token + refresh token
[Embedded Notebook Editor\nWebView Host Bridge] ..> [Notebook Editor\nwith AI Sidebar\nand Version History] : Shares editor experience

API --> [Auth Interceptor\n+ JWT Service] : Protected routes
[Controllers] --> [Business Services]
[Auth Interceptor\n+ JWT Service] ..> [Controllers]
[Business Services] --> [Repositories]

[Business Services] --> [Authentication]
[Business Services] --> [User/Profile]
[Business Services] --> [Category]
[Business Services] --> [Notebook]
[Business Services] --> [Notebook Versioning]
[Business Services] --> [AI Config + AI Query]
[Business Services] --> [Quiz]
[Business Services] --> [Flashcard]
[Business Services] --> [Playlist]
[Business Services] --> [Playback Queue]
[Business Services] --> [Admin Endpoints]

[Repositories] --> DB : Spring Data JPA
[Authentication] --> Google : Google sign-in
[Authentication] --> Email : Verification + reset email
[AI Config + AI Query] --> AIProvider : AI responses
[AI Config + AI Query] ..> DB : Encrypted API key\nconfiguration storage
[Notebook] ..> [Notebook Versioning] : Save event -> snapshot
[Playlist] ..> [Playback Queue] : Selected playlist source
[Quiz] ..> [Notebook] : Optional notebook-based study content
[Flashcard] ..> [Notebook] : Optional notebook-based study content

note bottom of API
Layered flow:
Controller -> Service -> Repository -> Database

Security flow:
Client token -> Auth Interceptor -> JWT validation

Integration flow:
AI, email, and Google services are invoked by backend services only
end note

@enduml
